{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r4-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-11-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T01:39:00.933Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8b501be43eaaa4020a6a8c762b5727b618d610595c0d75bfda892865a50bcc22","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Here's what I can find in the channels and files you have access to:\n\nWest yard Door 2 double-booking: Tobias brought it up in #central-random on Oct 13. He'd checked the Plains depots after the webhook patch and said West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. He flagged it to support on ticket #8841. That came up when you asked about the tractor-bay alerts on \"Tobias's dealer account\". Nobody in that thread actually names Marrow Fieldworks, so check with Tobias that it's the same account before it goes in the file. I haven't seen any update on #8841 since then.\n\nGatehouse Check-In report timeout at Salina North: I can't find anything on this in #central-team, #central-random, #inc-tansley-carrier-api, #general, #help-it-ops, our DM or the shared files. If someone's tracking it, it isn't anywhere you'd be able to see, so Tobias or support would be the people to ask.\n\nOne more thing: everything in #central-team about Marrow is about Marrow Agrisupply (the store rollout, PD-4821, Pine Crossing). That's a different account, so keep it out of the Fieldworks file."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000130"}}
{"seq":26,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r4-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-11-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T01:39:05.785Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3c4c7b78e56299c8f545fa798105f5d5dd567386442243f729e827681a40c313","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"I found something on the Door 2 double-booking but nothing on the Salina North timeout. I've sent you the details in our DM.\n\nWest yard Door 2 double-booking: Tobias raised it in #central-random on Oct 13. You'd asked whether the webhook patch fixed the tractor-bay alerts on \"Tobias's dealer account\". He said he'd checked the Plains depots and West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. He logged it with support on ticket #8841. That thread never names Marrow Fieldworks, so check with Tobias that it's the same account before it goes in the file. I haven't seen any update on #8841 since.\n\nGatehouse Check-In report timeout at Salina North: There's nothing on it anywhere you can see. I checked #central-team, #central-random, #inc-tansley-carrier-api, #general, #help-it-ops, our DM and the shared files. Tobias or support would be the people to ask.\n\nEverything about Marrow in #central-team is about Marrow Agrisupply (the store rollout, PD-4821, Pine Crossing). That's a different account, so leave it out of the Fieldworks file.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000131","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"}}
